{
  "html": "\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-magazine\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #315e8b; background-image: url(\u0026#34;data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAACAAAAAgCAIAAAD8GO2jAAAAT0lEQVR42u3RoQ3AMAxE0atZvFIW6kCZ9UwDIhUH1Oyzb2JZfs98l12SJGWO3zvsyhxn6Oho2vt19N1+Olr/YxcGGGCAAQYYYIABBhhc9gaFIgGH/e6S2gAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\u0026#34;); background-size: 32px 32px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #ffffff; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 16px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"background-color: #e7edf3; border-left: 1px dashed #315e8b; box-sizing: border-box; color: #2b425b; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 24px 20px; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"background-color: #e6ceb0; border: 1px dashed #795a37; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 0 26px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 26px 18px; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; color: #2b425b; display: block; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; text-align: left; width: auto\"\u003e像一本用旧牛仔布包书皮的随身旅行本，耐看、随性，装得下沿途所有热气腾腾的片段。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 0 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; text-align: left; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/artisan-bakery.jpg\" alt=\"阳光石台上的法式可颂与冰拿铁\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 28px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 16px 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px dashed #315e8b; color: #2b425b; display: block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0; padding-bottom: 14px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e牛仔丹宁肌理的率性日常\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #2b425b; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\"\u003e靛蓝牛仔斜纹底与复古车缝细节自带潮酷手作感，让生活图文跳脱传统框架。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"background-color: #d2deeb; border: 1px dashed #315e8b; border-radius: 14px; color: #2b425b; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 24px 0; padding: 22px; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\"\u003e好穿的牛仔越洗越顺手，好记的日常越翻越有味道。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 28px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 16px 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px dashed #315e8b; color: #2b425b; display: block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0; padding-bottom: 14px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e丹宁风的百搭内容场景\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003eCitywalk、穿搭分享与复古市集探店\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e摄影胶片日记与青年文化观察\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e独特织物底纹在列表中辨识度拉满\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #5a718b; color: #2b425b; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 32px 0 0; padding: 18px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e背上包继续走，下一条街角还有新故事。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
